MedShield AI Architecture

MedShield AI acts as a secure governance gateway between AI agents and healthcare data systems such as Electronic Health Record platforms.

Instead of allowing AI models or agents to directly access patient records, all requests pass through MedShield AI where security policies, compliance checks, and anomaly detection are enforced.

Typical request flow

1 User or AI agent requests patient information
2 MedShield AI policy engine evaluates the request
3 HIPAA and CCPA compliance checks are performed
4 Session limits and policy rules are enforced
5 Anomaly detection monitors query behavior
6 Approved requests access the synthetic EHR dataset
7 All events are logged for auditing and compliance

Blocked requests are logged and mitigation alerts are triggered.

